@title 3D Heat: Heat flow modes, device paths and the cloud that moves with the air
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Tadjiro: heat flow was hard to evaluate. Heat flow now has modes like Flow (Carried by air, Through solids, Air and solids, Flux map), Paths pins each device's split into air, plate and radiation, and Cloud > Moves plays the cloud with the solved air flow from cold air. Pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
# Opening Heat on a small cabinet starts an automatic run, which greys out the Quality row: stop it first.
click_text Cancel
wait 10
# With Auto on a stopped run starts again at once and greys out the Quality row: switch Auto off.
click_text Auto #1
wait 10
# The run that Auto had started again is still going: stop it too.
try click_text Cancel
wait 10
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 200
expect_not "Preliminary"
click_text Paths
wait 20
shot paths
click_text Cloud
wait 20
click_text Moves
wait_s 3
shot moving-early
wait_s 8
shot moving-later
expect "Moving cloud:"
check_layout
